# Berkeley AI Certificate Module 17

The goal is to analyze a set of data coming from a Portuguese banking institution.
It provides understanding of the problem and findings from the data. Based on the
understanding of the data, it provides recommendations for the next steps.

## Data Source

https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/222/bank+marketing

## Finding

Given all the models, looks like DecisionTree is the best model. It is easy to interpret the results by looking
at the output of the tree and you can tell which features are used for predicting the outcome. Based on the DT
tree visualation, the following features can better predict the campaign outcomes:

- social and  economic attributes
- number of contacts performed by the campaign
- number of days that passed by after the client was last contacted
- contact type
- marital status

The other models, including LogisticRegression, KNN, SVC and Stochastic Gradient Descent all performs similarily.
KNN and LogisticRegression take less time compared to SVC and SGD. It is hard to see feature is more important for SVC and SGD.
